    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers over 349,000\n\nBuilt in 2019, No. 15 Manor Grove offers you all the pluses of a newly built home with the advantages of having such extras as flooring, lighting, window dressing, extra storage and the massive plus of a 15 sqm block built garden room to the rear.\nThis 103 sqm, end terrace home is presented in turn-key condition throughout having been a happy and very much loved home from the beginning.\nOn the ground floor there is a south facing living room with kitchen/diner to the rear. There is patio door access from the dining area to the low maintenance rear garden with garden room. Using the same flooring through most of the ground floor makes the flow through the entire seamless. There is also a guest WC on the ground floor along with understair storage - a great bonus. Upstairs are three bedrooms, all with built-in storage, and the same laminate flooring throughout.\nThis is a wonderful home, still covered by its 10 year Homebond and is a great alternative to a brand new build in town.\nMains services, air to water heating, off street parking, low maintenance rear garden with block built 15 sqm room (with power)."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.6m x 2m\nwith laminate flooring, glazed panel beside front door increases natural light, understair storage\n\nLiving Room - 4.9m x 3.9m\nwith laminate flooring, feature wall with electric fire and area with socket for TV above\n\nGuest WC - 1.7m x 1.6m\nwith tiled floor and part-tiled walls, WC and WHB\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.9m x 4.7m\nwith laminate flooring, electric hob, eye level oven and microwave, integrated dishwasher and fridge freezer. Island return 1.8m x 0.9m. Patio door to rear garden\n\nLanding - 3.8m x 2.1m\nwith carpet, window adds to natural light, attic hatch. Hot Press off\n\nBathroom - 2.1m x 1.7m\nwith tiled floor, bath surround and part-tiled walls, WC, WHB, bath with mains shower overhead, LED mirror\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.7m x 3.4m\nrear facing room with laminate flooring and triple wardrobe. En-suite room\n\nEn-Suite - 2.6m x 1.2m\nwith tiled floor and part-tiled walls, WC, WHB, mains shower, LED mirror\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.7m x 3m\nfront-facing room with laminate flooring, and triple wardrobe\n\nBedroom 3 - 3m x 2.5m\nfront-facing room with laminate flooring and double wardrobe\n\nGarden Room/Office/Gym - 4.9m x 3m\nwith laminate flooring and French doors. Separate power supply\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>103 sqm end terrace home</li><li>15 sqm garden room, currently gym area</li><li>Large south facing living room</li><li>Kitchen/dining to the rear with patio door access to garden</li><li>3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms upstairs</li><li>Low maintenance rear garden</li><li>Off-street parking and side access</ul>"
      },
